::ingredients

(olive oil) 3tbsp
(onion; yellow, medium) 1
(ginger, fresh, grated) 1tbsp
(garlic, minced) 4 cloves
(yellow curry, mild madras) 2tbsp
(salt, sea) 1tsp
(lentils, red, dried) 1 cup
(water) 4-5 cups
(tomato, plum, chopped) 5
(lemon: juice) of 1 lemon
(cilantro, fresh, chopped, lightly packed) 1 cup
(heat seasoning) = (red chillies, dried) to taste -OR- (cayenne pepper) to taste
(cinnamon, ground) 1/4tsp

::equipment

(pot, soup)

::instructions

(olive oil) <heat, soup pot>
(onion) <sauté, 5m>
    + (garlic) + (ginger) <sauté, 5m more>
    + (yellow curry) + (heat seasoning) + (cinnamon) + (salt) <sauté, 5m more>
{dahl} = (olive oil) + (onion) + (garlic) + (ginger) + (yellow curry) + (heat seasoning) + (cinnamon) + (salt) + (water) 4 cups
{dahl} <stir>
    + (tomato) + (lentils)
    <bring to boil>
    <simmer, lower heat a bit, 20m>
    + (lemon: juice) + (cilantro)
    + (water) more if too thick
    <simmer, 10m more or until lentils completely tender; may take a while>

